#: includes/admin-fields.php:763
msgid ""
"This one is WordPress’s own: it can be renamed, reordered, made required or "
"hidden, but it keeps its type and cannot be deleted."
msgstr ""
"Questo è di WordPress: si può rinominare, riordinare, rendere obbligatorio o "
"nascondere, ma mantiene il suo tipo e non si può eliminare."

#: includes/admin-fields.php:764
msgid ""
"“Country” shows the full list with its dial codes; “Phone with country code” "
"splits the number in two and stores it in international format."
msgstr ""
"«Paese» mostra l’elenco completo con i prefissi; «Telefono con prefisso» "
"divide il numero in due e lo salva in formato internazionale."

#: includes/admin-fields.php:777
msgid "Who can change it"
msgstr "Chi può modificarlo"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:787
msgid "Whenever they want"
msgstr "Quando vogliono"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:794
msgid "Only a few times, and then no more"
msgstr "Solo alcune volte, e poi basta"

#: includes/admin-fields.php:799
