msgstr "Client ID"

#: includes/admin-social.php:670
msgid "Secret"
msgstr "Secret"

#: includes/admin-social.php:697
msgid "Show the button"
msgstr "Mostrare il pulsante"

#: includes/admin-social.php:713
msgid ""
"The buttons are drawn by the sign-in shortcode, together with the email "
"form. There is nothing else to place."
msgstr ""
"I pulsanti li disegna lo shortcode di accesso, insieme al modulo e-mail. Non "
"c’è altro da posizionare."

#. translators: %s: provider name
#: includes/admin-social.php:749
#, php-format
msgid ""
"To let people sign in with their %s account you have to create an app there. "
"Below is the whole thing, click by click."
msgstr ""
"Perché le persone possano accedere con il loro account %s bisogna creare "
"un’app lì. Qui c’è tutto, clic per clic."

