msgstr "La URL che ti chiederanno"

#: includes/admin-social.php:756
msgid ""
"Keep it at hand: one of the steps below asks for it, and it has to be pasted "
"exactly as it is."
msgstr ""
"Tienila a portata di mano: uno dei passi qui sotto la chiede, e va incollata "
"esattamente com’è."

#: includes/admin-social.php:766
msgid ""
"Depending on the provider it is called redirect URI, callback URL, return "
"URL or authorized redirect URL."
msgstr ""
"A seconda del provider si chiama redirect URI, callback URL, return URL o "
"authorized redirect URL."

#. translators: %s: provider name
#: includes/admin-social.php:773
#, php-format
msgid "Step by step in %s"
msgstr "Passo per passo in %s"

#: includes/admin-social.php:780
