msgid "And then, here"
msgstr "E poi, qui"

#: includes/admin-social.php:791
msgid ""
"Paste the client ID and the secret in Settings, run the live test, and turn "
"the button on."
msgstr ""
"Incolla il client ID e il secret in Impostazioni, lancia il test dal vivo e "
"attiva il pulsante."

#: includes/admin-social.php:804
msgid "I already created the app"
msgstr "Ho già creato l’app"

#: includes/admin-social.php:940
msgid "What this provider asks for"
msgstr "Che cosa chiede questo provider"

#: includes/admin-social.php:827
msgid "Run the live test"
msgstr "Lancia il test dal vivo"

#: includes/admin-social.php:828
msgid "Test it again"
msgstr "Testalo di nuovo"

#: includes/admin-social.php:899
